<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6046] MathJAX scripts fail to load with 404 errors</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6046</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m running the 0.11.0 docker images of Zeppelin. MathJax expressions aren&apos;t rendered, I believe due to missing JS scripts.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the browser development console I see 404 errors for the following JS scripts, which are part of the MathJax system:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;jax/input/TeX/config.js&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;jax/output/HTML_config.js&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;extensions/tex2jax.js&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;MathMenu.js&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;MathZoom.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;To reproduce&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run &lt;tt&gt;docker run -p 8080:8080 --rm --name zeppelin apache/zeppelin:0.11.1&#160;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Create a new note &amp;amp; enter the MathJax example:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.11.1/usage/display_system/basic.html#mathematical-expressions&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Apache Zeppelin 0.11.1 Documentation: Basic Display System in Apache Zeppelin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected result; Rendered Math&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actual result: Raw MathJax output&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Browsers tested: Chrome 119, Firefox 102&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin official docker images, run using&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;docker run -p 8080:8080 --rm --name zeppelin apache/zeppelin:0.11.1&#160;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
